# License

## The deck box design

Derived from **"Parametric Scifi Deck Box With Two Netrunner Emblems"** by
Thingiverse user **Austin** — <https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:39997> — which
is licensed **Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike**. The original listing
does not state a version.

This repository is a derivative work and is released under the same terms:
**Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike** — <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/>

That covers `src/deckbox.scad`, the exported STLs in `files/`, and the renders
in `images/renders/`.

